.claude/skills/developing-with-streamlit

# Evaluation: model answers on the REAL samples stay private until expert labels exist,
# so the labelling can remain blind (see docs/eval-design.md). Progress logs are noise;
# the scored results live in data/eval_synth*/runs/*.csv and results.json.
data/eval/runs/
data/eval*/run_*.log
data/eval_synth/runs_incomplete/
